.TH IMUD\-MAVLINK.CONF 5 "2026-07-13" "imud 1.5" "File Formats Manual"
.SH NAME
imud\-mavlink.conf \- configuration file for imud-mavlink(8)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.I /etc/imud/imud-mavlink.conf
.SH DESCRIPTION
Configuration for the
.BR imud-mavlink (8)
bridge daemon, which reads imud's binary stream socket and emits MAVLink (v1 or
v2) HEARTBEAT/ATTITUDE/ATTITUDE_QUATERNION over UDP and/or serial.  The bridge
reads
.B only
this file (never
.IR imud.conf ).
The file is one
.B [imud-mavlink]
section of
.IR key " = " value
lines; strings are double-quoted and
.RB \(oq # \(cq
begins a comment.  Requires imud's
.B [stream]
output enabled.
.PP
Keys marked
.B [hot]
are reloaded on
.BR SIGHUP ;
keys marked
.B [restart]
take effect on the next service start.
.SH KEYS
.TP
.B enabled
.RI ( bool ,\ default:\ false )\ [restart]
Enable the MAVLink bridge.
.TP
.B socket
.RI ( string ,\ default:\ \(dq/run/imud/imud-stream.sock\(dq )\ [restart]
imud stream socket to read.
.TP
.B version
.RI ( int ,\ default:\ 2 )\ [hot]
MAVLink protocol version: 1 or 2.
.TP
.B system_id
.RI ( int ,\ default:\ 1 )\ [restart]
MAVLink system id.
.TP
.B component_id
.RI ( int ,\ default:\ 1 )\ [restart]
MAVLink component id (raise, e.g. 191, when sharing a bus with a real
autopilot).
.TP
.B rate_hz
.RI ( int ,\ default:\ 10 )\ [hot]
ATTITUDE / ATTITUDE_QUATERNION rate in Hz (HEARTBEAT is fixed at 1 Hz).
.TP
.B send_attitude
.RI ( bool ,\ default:\ true )\ [hot]
Emit ATTITUDE (#30).
.TP
.B send_attitude_quaternion
.RI ( bool ,\ default:\ true )\ [hot]
Emit ATTITUDE_QUATERNION (#31).
.TP
.B udp_enabled
.RI ( bool ,\ default:\ false )\ [restart]
Enable UDP output.
.TP
.B udp_addr
.RI ( string ,\ default:\ \(dq127.0.0.1\(dq )\ [hot]
UDP destination host (e.g. a ground station).
.TP
.B udp_port
.RI ( int ,\ default:\ 14550 )\ [hot]
UDP destination port (QGroundControl default).
.TP
.B serial_enabled
.RI ( bool ,\ default:\ false )\ [restart]
Enable serial output.
.TP
.B serial_device
.RI ( string ,\ default:\ \(dq/dev/serial0\(dq )\ [restart]
Serial device (e.g.
.IR /dev/serial0 ,
.IR /dev/ttyAMA0 ,
.IR /dev/ttyUSB0 ).
.TP
.B serial_baud
.RI ( int ,\ default:\ 57600 )\ [restart]
Serial baud rate (9600\(en921600).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/imud/imud-mavlink.conf
This file.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR imud-mavlink (8),
.BR imud.conf (5),
.BR imud (8)
